     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Wed, Mar 8, 2017 at 7:01 AM, Avner Kantor <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">avner...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;border-right:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex;padding-right:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"rtl\">נפלא ומרשים. כל הכבוד!<br><br><br></div><div dir=\"rtl\">ותודה על השיתוף<br></div></div><div><div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Sun, Mar 5, 2017 at 10:51 PM, amit gal <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">amit...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>looks impressive! I&#39;ll definitely take a look and try sending some comments.<br><br><br></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><span>On Sun, Mar 5, 2017 at 9:22 PM, Jonathan Rosenblatt <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">joh...@bgu.ac.il</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br></span><div><div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Dear all<div><br></div><div>I have been writing a book for my upcoming graduate course (name simply  &quot;R&quot;). </div><div>The course will be given next year at BGU.</div><div>In the meanwhile, I am publishing the course&#39;s (unfinished) text in that hope that:</div><div>- You may find it useful.</div><div>- You may suggest improvement. </div><div>- You may catch errors. </div><div>If you feel extra generous, you may also fork the bookdown source, and commit edits yourself. </div><div><br></div><div>HTML: <a href=\"http://www.john-ros.com/Rcourse/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.john-ros.com/Rcourse/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496599635000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3OsVty5R7EW9P2JIyaMGoi\">http://www.john-ros.com/Rcourse/</a></div><div>PDF: <a href=\"http://www.john-ros.com/Rcourse/Rcourse.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.john-ros.com/Rcourse/Rcourse.pdf&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496599636000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0SvRPntG84geZ5JyofQljA\">http://www.john-ros.com/Rcourse/Rcourse.pdf</a></div><div>DOCX: <a href=\"http://www.john-ros.com/Rcourse/Rcourse.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.john-ros.com/Rcourse/Rcourse.pdf&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496599636000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0SvRPntG84geZ5JyofQljA\">http://www.john-ros.com/Rcourse/Rcourse.pdf</a></div><div>Source: <a href=\"https://github.com/johnros/Rcourse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/johnros/Rcourse&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496599636000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2qNKSnztyOMjHV-PFCR45q\">https://github.com/johnros/Rcourse</a></div><span><font color=\"#888888\"><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br clear=\"all\"><div><br></div>-- <br><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"font-size:small\">--</div><div style=\"font-size:small\">Jonathan Rosenblatt</div><div style=\"font-size:small\">Dept. of Industrial Engineering and Management</div><div style=\"font-size:small\">Ben Gurion University of the Negev</div><div style=\"font-size:small\"><a href=\"http://www.john-ros.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.john-ros.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496599636000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3vEH0rrrJ6h1SHYpIhT5A8\">www.john-ros.com</a></div><div><br></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><